    <string name="surface_secret_intro_body">In the disguise launcher, after holding the control center battery or the About page back area, tap this passcode silently on the unchanged screen to open the full drawer or the management menu.</string>
    <string name="surface_secret_intro_zones_title">Five zones</string>
    <string name="surface_secret_intro_zones">Top-left 1, top-right 2, bottom-left 3, bottom-right 4; the circle in the middle is 5 and wins over corners. Zones cover the whole screen, regardless of safe area or display size.</string>
    <string name="surface_secret_intro_rules_title">Ends automatically</string>
    <string name="surface_secret_intro_rules">Each tap is checked immediately: one wrong digit ends it, all correct succeeds at once, no confirm button. A swipe, 10 s without input, screen off, a call or leaving cancels. Real verification shows no hints at all.</string>
