    <string name="surface_tutorial_level_reset">Reset passcode</string>
    <string name="surface_tutorial_level_drawer_intro">Swipe down on the face to open the control center → hold the battery 2 s and release → enter the hidden passcode → the full drawer opens → go back to the face.</string>
    <string name="surface_tutorial_level_menu_intro">Swipe up on the face for apps → Settings → About → hold the back button 2 s, drag right past 3/4 of the safe area, release → passcode → hidden menu → temporary full settings (really opens Settings).</string>
    <string name="surface_tutorial_level_reset_intro">From the face to About → hold the back button 2 s, drag down past 3/4 of the safe area, release → tap the build number → set and confirm a practice passcode (saving is only simulated; your real passcode stays).</string>
